{
 "id": "HT-EV-02",
 "tmp_base": "repo",
 "layer": "H",
 "owner": "skills",
 "note": "Evidence (scratch-clone patch series, handoff-spec §10 deny names and actions) as changed by BD-1 (AT-ST-10): evidence --clone gates each patch before anything is written. A patch that touches a deny-listed path (.netrc, *.sqlite, also as an uncommitted change) is rebuilt without it: 0001-<sha8>.partial.patch holds README.md only, with one withheld row <clone>#<sha8>:app.sqlite; a commit or uncommitted diff whose every path is blocked gives only the withheld row and no patch file; a patch whose text has a HARD hit is withheld whole; a harmless patch is copied. No raw patch is left anywhere under the handoff root (.staging included): grep_absent of the .netrc password, the sqlite text and the token over $ROOT",
 "now": "2026-10-21T14:05:12+03:00",
 "tz": "Etc/GMT-3",
 "steps": [
  {
   "setup": [
    {
     "repo": {
      "branch": "feature/LAB-7-retry",
      "commits": [
       {
        "files": {
         "app/retry.rb": "x = 1\n"
        },
        "msg": "seed"
       }
      ]
     },
     "at": "$TMP/repo"
    },
    {
     "repo": {
      "commits": [
       {
        "files": {
         "README.md": "scratch\n",
         "app.sqlite": "SQLite format 3 RRP01-SQLITE-CANARY-one\n"
        },
        "msg": "seed with a db"
       },
       {
        "files": {
